      <li class="service-card">
        <h3>Catalog, Product Data &amp; Merchandising</h3>
        <p class="service-tagline">Clean, comprehensive product information to give your customer the warm and fuzzy.</p>
        <p>
          Taxonomy, variants, attributes, and imagery that stay coherent as the catalog grows. Search and
          collection tuning, pricing and promotion rules, and feeds to Google, Meta, and marketplaces that
